{'symbol': 'MKTX', 'date': '2022-04-05 06:34:00', 'title': 'MARKETAXESS ANNOUNCES MONTHLY VOLUME STATISTICS FOR MARCH 2022', 'text': 'NEW YORK, APRIL 05, 2022 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- MARKETAXESS HOLDINGS INC. (NASDAQ: MKTX), THE OPERATOR OF A LEADING ELECTRONIC TRADING PLATFORM FOR FIXED-INCOME SECURITIES, AND THE PROVIDER OF MARKET DATA AND POST-TRADE SERVICES FOR THE GLOBAL FIXED-INCOME MARKETS, TODAY ANNOUNCED MONTHLY TRADING VOLUME FOR MARCH 2022 OF $894.6 BILLION, CONSISTING OF $285.1 BILLION IN CREDIT VOLUME AND $609.5 BILLION IN RATES VOLUME.'}